      "text": "Screen 0 picks a persona; screens 1\u201314 are the product. Every screen links to the next, back to the globe, or across the tabs \u2014 the way the product would.\n\nThree screens respond to input: the AI column on 7, the comment thread on 10, the thesis update on 13.\n\nThe globe screens (4, 11, 14) draw a real orthographic dot globe on canvas \u2014 the land field, camera tour, arcs and pulses are ported from the always-on-v0 Spotlight Home globe.",
