      "y": 0,
      "w": 400,
      "fill": "purple",
      "text": "The demo now opens here. Pick a seat and it starts on the screen that seat cares about \u2014 narrated.\n\nNarration is spoken by the browser itself, so there is nothing to sign in to and no audio file to ship. Browsers need a click before they will speak, which is exactly what picking a persona is. The chip at the bottom-right of every screen turns it off, replays the line, or invites a tap if the browser held the first one back.\n\nElevenLabs reads are being recorded separately \u2014 script per screen in artifacts/thesis-builder-demo/NARRATION_SCRIPTS.md."
